  "limitations": [
    "Tiny-NeRF port is position-only; no directional head, hierarchical sampling or production acceleration.",
    "Fixed low-resolution, finite-step run is not the NeRF paper benchmark or converged full-scale reconstruction.",
    "NeRF excludes held-out image colours; SfM pose/calibration already used all52 original views.",
    "Existing MVS was reconstructed/textured from all52 images, including these held-out cameras; scores are not a fair generalization ranking.",
    "Upper85% mask excludes floor; moving objects/reflections may remain. Temporal adjacent holdout is interpolation.",
    "MVS holes are retained; common-pixel score and missing-as-black score answer different questions.",
    "No independent metric scale or site control. Radiance-field appearance and relative density depth do not certify wall geometry."
